    body: 'A rate card shows where experienced people sit, not where a first project lands. Start with the beginner end, then raise your rate as proof builds up.',
  },
  {
    num: '02',
    title: 'Counting billed money as income',
    body: 'Platform fees, currency conversion, tax and unpaid time looking for clients all come off the bill. Track what is left after delivery, fees and tax.',
  },
  {
    num: '03',
    title: 'Learning four skills at once',
    body: 'One core skill and one helper skill, with proof, beat a pile of half-finished courses.',
  },
