    q: 'Should I pay for a course to learn a high-earning freelance skill?',
    a: 'Try free YouTube lessons and low-priced courses first. Pay more only for feedback, a clear sequence or access you cannot get otherwise. Judge the specific course by the instructor\'s recent work, last update, graded projects and what past learners actually got. Our strongest suggestion is to keep a course fee near a tenth of the education budget.',
